  "bodyHash": "47ZDSYaxEpk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">次元袋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為 Minecraft 加入了魔法便攜儲存功能，完美融入遊戲世界。將你的物品裝在時尚的袋子裡，隨時隨地取用，大幅減少物品欄雜亂的煩惱。🎒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共有三種等級的袋子可供選擇，儲存容量逐漸提升：從小巧的皮革袋到能裝下整個建築計畫的巨大金袋。直接從快捷欄打開袋子，或是在物品欄中無縫互動。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組的設計靈感來自現代束口袋機制，讓你可以瀏覽內容、放入物品、精準取出所需物品，無需不斷開啟獨立選單來管理儲存空間。強大的工具提示預覽與直觀的操作，每個袋子使用起來都快速又便利。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對於重視所有物的冒險家來說，袋子還可以附上「</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保存</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">」附魔，讓袋子在死亡時得以保留，代價是消耗附魔等級。💎</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三種袋子等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可製作皮革袋、鐵袋與金袋，儲存容量逐步提升，滿足你的需求。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">物品欄存取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接從袋子中放入與取出物品，無需開啟專屬介面。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在物品工具提示中直接顯示袋子內容，一眼就能看出每個袋子裡裝了什麼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">選擇任何存放物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇你想互動的存放物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">所選物品資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">瀏覽袋子內容時，立即顯示目前所選物品的資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過直觀的物品欄互動，快速放入與取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">跨欄拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在物品欄間拖曳滑鼠，一次批量放入或取出物品，大幅加快物品管理速度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 上為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）可移動單一物品而非整組物品，並精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視覺提示會顯示手中物品是否可以放入，以及袋子裡是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">專屬袋子介面：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">隨時從快捷欄打開袋子，享受傳統儲存畫面。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">保存附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為袋子附上「保存」附魔，避免死亡時遺失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">高度可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂儲存容量、互動方式、操作、提示行為與視覺功能，打造最適合你的遊玩風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">⏩ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">用戶端與伺服端皆需安裝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">⏩ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge 皆需）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">⏩ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">FABRIC API</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">（Fabric 專用）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">⏩ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">（Fabric 專用）</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲中透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者為 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔都位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，檔案名稱根據設定檔類型分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型的設定檔都存在於每個模組中，也可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">RWTema</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，這個模組的靈感來自他們 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組舊版本中的次元袋物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Nyffuuuh23</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了這些精美的材質！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
